{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22038","headline":"叹鲁二首 一 · 白居易","name":"叹鲁二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季桓心岂忠，其富过周公。\n阳货道岂正，其权执国命。\n由来富与权，不系才与贤。\n所托得其地，虽愚亦获安。\n彘肥因粪壤，鼠稳依社坛。\n虫兽尚如是，岂谓无因缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}